   "Is the cleaning process being continuously monitored? (temperature, pressure, and visual inspections)?",
   "Has dirty water and waste been properly managed? (Marpol compliance check)",
   "Has all slop water and wash residues been handled in compliance with MARPOL regulations?",
   "Section C - Description / Checks to be Conducted After Cleaning",
