   "Have the tank heating coils been inspected? (leakage, corrosion, or blockage issues.)",
   "Have the tank coatings been checked? (any damage to epoxy/zinc silicate/marine line coatings?)",
   "Has a visual inspection confirmed the tanks are free from previous cargo residues, discoloration, or contamination?",
   "Have tank covers, gaskets, and sealing elements been tested for proper sealing?",
