   "[E] Overboard valves connected to E/R bilges and bunker lines are closed and sealed.",
   "[E] All cargo and bunker tank hatch lids are closed. All sounding pipe caps are tight.",
   "[E] Bunker tank contents will be monitored at regular intervals.",
   "[E] At intervals not exceeding minutes",
